<title>FRANCE: Elf 1996 turnover 232.71 bln Ffr.</title>
<headline>Elf 1996 turnover 232.71 bln Ffr.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover				     232,707    vs  208,290</p>
<p>	 fourth quarter			    64,982   vs   52,078</p>
<p>Breakdown of 1996 by sector:</p>
<p>    Exploration/production		    20,238    vs   18,454</p>
<p>    Refining/distribution		    135,569    vs  111,944</p>
<p>    Chemical					53,255    vs   54,861</p>
<p>    Health					  23,645    vs   23,031</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures were released in the BALO legal announcements bulletin.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
